{"id":"vod_bf_23614","vodId":"23614","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔法少女魔法破坏者","name_cn":"魔法少女魔法破坏者","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/1c940d53ec6ab326f5c47700fc2f83eb.jpg"},"summary":"2008年——神秘势力的出现，动漫、游戏、漫画、音乐、铁路、cosplay等所有御宅文化都被排除的日本。周边被收容，宅男被以保护的名义镇压，人们仿佛失去了自我，毫无疑问。被负责维持秩序的组织“SSC”蹂躏，宅男以为已经灭亡了——但是，夺回被封锁的秋叶原后，出现了揭竿而起的人。年轻的革命者“御宅英雄”——比什么都热爱御宅文化，比谁都热爱秋叶的男人。还有仰慕他的3个魔法少女——“无政府”、“蓝”、“粉”。以2011年的日本为舞台，聚集在自由之旗下的宅男们——秋叶革命军，挑战SSC首领“SHOBON”的壮烈的战斗。为了这个可以破坏混沌和秩序，尽情地喜欢自己喜欢的东西的世界。聚集在自由旗帜下的宅男们啊。夺回被剥夺的文化掀起OTAKU COUNTER CULTURE !","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:18:44","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mofashaonvmofapohuaizhe/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapsh